5. Lada phi rwai ki jingrwai ka jingkmen, Shah Jisu wan hapoh dohnud;
Lada phin shongthait ha syrngiew ba tngen,
Shah Jisu wan hapoh dohnud.

1. Lada phi kwah ban ioh lait na ka pop, Don bor ha ka snam, bor ha ka snam;
