Na khuslai pyrthei pyllait,
kane ka sngi ngi shongthait;
Na khuslai pyrthei pyllait,
kane ka sngi ngi shongthait.

3. Hangne ban iaroh ngi wan, ia ka kyrteng khuid jong Me;
