ai ngin shem jingdon jong Me;
Trai, ai ha ngi ba ngin mad,
ka jingkhawai bym ju blad;
Trai, ai ha ngi ba ngin mad,
ka jingkhawai bym ju blad.

4. Ai ba gospel kan sawa, i’u nongpop kan jop noh phar;
