na ka jingdum pynshai kdar.
Kumne Sabbaton kin long,
haduh lem bad Me ban shong;
Kumne Sabbaton kin long,
haduh lem bad Me ban shong.

1. Ah Trai, ngi wan ba sngi la sep, Ban dem ha kjat jong Me;
