Kyud:
Khublei, khublei,
khublei, khublei, Mynta ngi ia pdiang sngewbha,
Sngi shongthait U Jehobah.

2. Hynriew sngi jingtrei la dep, Sabbaton sdang, sngi tang sep;
Sngi ba hynñiew U kyrkhu,
Ngi shongthait mynta bad U.

3. Bun ki pynkylla khongpong, Rakhe pynban sngi nyngkong;
Wad ia Kotbah phin shem te,
Ba kam kyrshan ia kane.

4. Baroh ba kren hok ki phla, Dei u briew ba pynkylla;
