Jingdum ka miet hangta kam kah.

Kyud:
Oh ri Beulah!
Beulah ba thiang!
Nalor ki lum nga peit kyndiang;
Duriaw phyrnai kum maw jaspar,
Ïingshongneh ruh la khreh lut phar;
