2. Ai Mynsiem jong Me Un shongneh, Mynsiem ban mon, hukum ban leh;
Jinglong lui lui bad jingshisha,
Kin iaid lang sha samoi samla.

1. Trai, jingkhawai jong Me, la khreh, Khuri hajan u kpu b’la kdiah;
